	(text "J7 -> STM32H7 (3.3 V logic)\nMCU_CLK: 5.12 MHz from H7 MCO2 (PC9), 40-60 % duty\n   -> U3 Schmitt buffer -> R80 -> ADC CLKIN (10 kSPS @ OSR 256)\nADC_SCLK/MOSI/MISO/CS: SPI mode 1 (CPOL 0, CPHA 1), ~8 MHz,\n   SPI clock from the same PLL as MCO2 (synchronous)\nADC_DRDY: data ready, active low -> DMA read of 10 words\nADC_SYNC_RESET: sync / reset (>= 2048 tCLKIN low), active low\nFit 33R series R at the H7 side on MCU_CLK, SCLK, MOSI, CS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5970963a-5330-406d-8c49-fc90379ec01b")
	)
	(text "R81/R82: place next to U2 (source termination)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68d6eabc-879f-42a3-a84e-4553e2e0ed4a")
	)
	(text "Ratio 1.0k/(1.1k+1.0k) = 0.476 -> op-amp ±2.45 V maps to ±1.17 V (ADS131M08 FS ±1.2 V).\nThevenin 524 Ω + 10 nF C0G -> fc ≈ 30 kHz. AINnN tied to GND at U2 (pseudo-differential).\nCH7 digitises the sacrificial-sensor output Vsac for diagnostics.\nChannel map (set by the PCB routing): AIN0=Vout1, AIN1=Vout4, AIN2=Vout2, AIN3=Vout3,\nAIN4=Vout5, AIN5=Vout6, AIN6=Vout7, AIN7=Vsac."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8d163cbb-06b6-47a5-9310-8f7a28795f05")
	)
	(text "Everything that's needed to \nacquire data, power and\nmodify it"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
